msgstr "MeshLibrary (បណ្ណាល័យ Mesh)"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Import from Scene (Ignore Transforms)"
msgstr "Import ពីឈុតឆាក (Scene) (មិនយក Transforms)"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Import from Scene (Apply Transforms)"
msgstr "Import ពីឈុតឆាក (Scene) (អនុវត្ត Transforms)"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Update from Scene"
msgstr "ធ្វើបច្ចុប្បន្នភាពពីឈុតឆាក (Scene)"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
#: modules/gridmap/editor/grid_map_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Filter Meshes"
msgstr "ច្រោះ Meshes"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"The item's name, shown in the editor. It can also be used to look up the "
"item later using [method MeshLibrary.find_item_by_name]."
msgstr ""
"ឈ្មោះរបស់ធាតុ ដែលបង្ហាញក្នុង editor។ អ្នកក៏អាចប្រើវាដើម្បីស្វែងរកធាតុនោះនៅពេលក្រោយ ដោយប្រើ "
"[method MeshLibrary.find_item_by_name] ផងដែរ។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"The item's mesh. Used by other parts of the engine (e.g. [GridMap], which "
"displays them in a 3D tile)."
msgstr ""
"Mesh របស់ធាតុ។ ត្រូវបានប្រើដោយផ្នែកផ្សេងៗនៃ engine (ឧទាហរណ៍ [GridMap] ដែលបង្ហាញវានៅក្នុ"
"ង 3D tile)។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "The transform to apply to the item's mesh."
msgstr "Transform ដែលត្រូវអនុវត្តលើ mesh របស់ធាតុ។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"The shadow casting mode used by the item's mesh. See [enum "
"RenderingServer.ShadowCastingSetting]."
msgstr ""
"របៀបបង្កើតស្រមោលដែលប្រើដោយ mesh របស់ធាតុ។ សូមមើល [enum "
"RenderingServer.ShadowCastingSetting]។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"The item's collision shapes.\n"
"The array should consist of [Shape3D] objects, each followed by a "
"[Transform3D] that will be applied to it. For shapes that should not have a "
"transform, use [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""
"រាងប៉ះទង្គិចរបស់ធាតុ។\n"
"Array គួរតែមានវត្ថុ [Shape3D] ហើយតាមពីក្រោយនីមួយៗដោយ [Transform3D] ដែលនឹងត្រូវអនុវត្តលើវា"
"។ សម្រាប់រាងដែលមិនគួរមាន transform សូមប្រើ [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "The item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "Navigation mesh របស់ធាតុ។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "The transform to apply to the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "Transform ដែលត្រូវអនុវត្តលើ navigation mesh របស់ធាតុ។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "The item's navigation layers bitmask."
msgstr "Bitmask នៃ navigation layers របស់ធាតុ។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "The texture to use as the item's preview icon in the editor."
msgstr "Texture ដែលត្រូវប្រើជារូបតំណាង preview របស់ធាតុនៅក្នុង editor។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid ""
"No items found inside the MeshLibrary.\n"
"You can add some by using the Add button on the left, or by importing them "
"from a scene file via the Import menu."
msgstr ""
"រកមិនឃើញធាតុនៅក្នុង MeshLibrary ទេ។\n"
"អ្នកអាចបន្ថែមធាតុដោយប្រើប៊ូតុង Add នៅខាងឆ្វេង ឬដោយ import វាពីឯកសារឈុតឆាក (Scene) តាមរ"
"យៈម៉ឺនុយ Import។"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Apply without Transforms"
msgstr "អនុវត្តដោយមិនយក Transforms"

#: editor/scene/3d/mesh_library_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "Apply with Transforms"
msgstr "អនុវត្តដោយយក Transforms"

#: editor/scene/3d/multimesh_editor_plugin.cpp
msgid "No mesh source specified (and no MultiMesh set in node)."
msgstr "មិនបានកំណត់ប្រភព mesh (ហើយគ្មាន MultiMesh ក្នុងណូត (Node) ទេ)។"

